{"id":"36b65d885669ea97","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-negation-complete.md","title":"Negation Complete","display":"df-negation-complete — Negation Complete","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-negation-complete","aliases":["92-df-negation-complete"],"display":"df-negation-complete — Negation Complete","depends_on":["[[92-df-theory]]","[[92-df-sentence]]","[[92-df-omega-complete]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-negation-complete"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-negation-complete</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-negation-complete — Negation Complete"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"87dbd27955ecb3b6\" href=\"?note=87dbd27955ecb3b6\" title=\"92-df-theory\">92-df-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0e5b54aafbcf6fc4\" href=\"?note=0e5b54aafbcf6fc4\" title=\"92-df-omega-complete\">92-df-omega-complete</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Theory}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Theory}_G\\)</span> (theory parameter and predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"87dbd27955ecb3b6\" href=\"?note=87dbd27955ecb3b6\" title=\"92-df-theory\">92-df-theory</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\)</span> (sentence set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NegComplete}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{NegComplete}_G\\)</span> (definition-target predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}negation\\text{-}complete} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{NegComplete}_G(T)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Theory}_G(T)\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;(\\varphi\\in T\\lor\\neg\\varphi\\in T)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}negation\\text{-}complete} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{NegComplete}_G(T)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Theory}_G(T)\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;(\\varphi\\in T\\lor\\neg\\varphi\\in T)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>否定完备（句法完备）表示每个句子或其否定属于闭合理论<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span></li>\n<li>它不同于<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0e5b54aafbcf6fc4\" href=\"?note=0e5b54aafbcf6fc4\" title=\"92-df-omega-complete\">92-df-omega-complete</a>的<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>完备，也不蕴含<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>一致性；一个相容的句法完备算术扩张仍可能<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>不一致</li>\n<li>若<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>有效可公理化、相容且包含足够算术，则Gödel不完备性推出<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\mathrm{NegComplete}_G(\\mathrm{Th}(G))\">\\(\\neg\\mathrm{NegComplete}_G(\\mathrm{Th}(G))\\)</span>；不能无条件写“系统<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>不完备”</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-theory","status":"resolved","id":"87dbd27955ecb3b6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"90f32e29c9d553ed","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-omega-complete","status":"resolved","id":"0e5b54aafbcf6fc4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-omega-complete]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-theory","status":"resolved","id":"87dbd27955ecb3b6","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G$ and $\\mathrm{Theory}_G$ (theory parameter and predicate, see [[92-df-theory]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"90f32e29c9d553ed","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sent}_G$ (sentence set, see [[92-df-sentence]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-omega-complete","status":"resolved","id":"0e5b54aafbcf6fc4","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"它不同于[[92-df-omega-complete]]的$\\omega$完备，也不蕴含$\\omega$一致性；一个相容的句法完备算术扩张仍可能$\\omega$不一致","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Theory}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NegComplete}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}negation\\text{-}complete} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{NegComplete}_G(T)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Theory}_G(T)\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;(\\varphi\\in T\\lor\\neg\\varphi\\in T)","display":true},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg\\mathrm{Neg